Add a binding and driver for the Samsung S6E3FC3 command-mode DSI panel
(AMS646YD04 module) used on the Samsung Galaxy A52 4G (a52q).

Based on v7.3-rc5. Not independently tested on hardware by the
submitter tooling; on-device verification pending.

